# HI  Welcome to FastApi Tutitorial

- first create vertual env or use docker container 
-
- command for create vertual env " python -m venv  envename"
- if venv lin not installed then install it using "pip inatall virtualenv"

-
-
# how to active Virtual env 

- command for mac os and  for window call me 
- source  vertualenv_name/bin/activate

# Install FastAPi + Uvicorn

- after vertual env activate 
- use command to install FastApi 
- "pip install fastapi uvicorn"
- 
## for better option use standard version
-
- "pip install fastapi[standard]"


# To see installed pip library use command 
- to check  installed pip lib use command 
- "pip list " 




# How to start with fasttapi 

- create app directory 

- in main project directory create main.py file 
- - to run use commadn 
- - "python -m uvicorn main:app"

